			"arabicnumber": 2555,
			"text": "It was narrated from `Imran bin Husain that :a woman came to the Prophet (ﷺ) and confessed to committing fornication. He issued orders, and her garments were tightened around her (so that her private parts would not become uncovered) then he stoned her, then he offered the funeral prayer for her",
